{"reviews":[{"id":"B0BC2XLWML-0","r":4.0,"t":"Good practice hand manikin.","x":"I would have given 5 stars if there were different shades of hands to choose from.  Not all hands are pale white and testing out different colors on different skin tones would be great.","h":15,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2020"},{"id":"B0BC2XLWML-1","r":5.0,"t":"Flexible hand","x":"[[VIDEOID:4a43ff3f138d900f7ce106d0dc3b7b92]] Hand is great for showing different styles. Displaying different designs. Flexible fingers.","h":14,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2020"},{"id":"B0BC2XLWML-2","r":5.0,"t":"Great","x":"I love it, im trying to learn from watching YouTube on how to do acrylic nails and this hand works perfectly for me to practice on.","h":9,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B0BC2XLWML-3","r":1.0,"t":"hated it","x":"There are no clear directions how to take off the nails.  I still haven't been able to get 2 of the nails off.  The video show how to get it off but doesn't tell or show you what they using to get the nails off.","h":7,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2021"},{"id":"B0BC2XLWML-4","r":5.0,"t":"Me encanta","x":"[[VIDEOID:e0e9f674a549a025d94dc9bfcd8f46bd]] La mano se ve hermosa y delicada me encanta mostrar mi trabajo en ella, es muy flexible para hacer diferentes poses, de verdad la recomiendo!!!","h":7,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2022"},{"id":"B0BC2XLWML-5","r":5.0,"t":"Great product and arrived quick","x":"This item is great. Good quality and feels realistic. I started doing acrylics in November 22 and I must say this is not beginner friendly. I ended up purchasing a different practice hand. The hard plastic one with the visible/movable joints.  While completing sets of the drill bit touches this hand it literally cuts/tears it up. I\u2019m very good with my drill and having control but I just couldn\u2019t prevent from damaging this practice hand. I don\u2019t think it\u2019s beginning friendly. Or at least not the ","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2023"},{"id":"B0BC2XLWML-6","r":3.0,"t":"Holly nail beds!","x":"The nail beds are huge which makes it hard to glue any nail or tip on it with glue or gel. The fingers are not very flexible and you can not slide fake nails into the nail bed if you are looking for a hand that does that, this one is not it sis!","h":6,"v":1,"d":"May 2022"},{"id":"B0BC2XLWML-7","r":4.0,"t":"Overall a great product","x":"[[VIDEOID:29c064da56fc39dfb71fd363c385a58b]] This is overall a great product. The hand is flexible and feels like a human hand. I just really wish it was a easier way to remove the acrylic nails after I\u2019m done with the application.","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2022"},{"id":"B0BC2XLWML-8","r":4.0,"t":"Does not come with stand.","x":"There are two for one deals and much better deals. I purchased this just for the stand. Hand is nice, but over priced without the stand.","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B0BC2XLWML-9","r":5.0,"t":"I love it","x":"I am a beginner nail tech and man is this helpful! I ruined my own nails by constantly doing them and am not experienced enough to do a real persons hand so this is super fun to use and the mail comes off super easy if you apply base coat. I highly recommend","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2023"},{"id":"B0BC2XLWML-10","r":5.0,"t":"Very good quality.","x":"[[VIDEOID:f22cc6bf0596fceb052ce8517e0657e6]] That is an excellent product, easy to use, have very good mobility and perfect size. I love it!!","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2022"},{"id":"B0BC2XLWML-11","r":5.0,"t":"Great product!!!","x":"[[VIDEOID:28b78952e5c57df94278fb3076ff0532]] Bought this for my daughter to practice. She loves it! Flexible fingers & hole compatible with her mannequin head attachment. Great buy!","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2021"},{"id":"B0BC2XLWML-12","r":4.0,"t":"Flexible","x":"It has a great texture and flexibility. I haven't used it yet, but based on handling it seems that it'll be fun to work with. The seller is hospitable. Will update after first use.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2023"},{"id":"B0BC2XLWML-13","r":1.0,"t":"DO NOT USE NAIL GLUE","x":"[[VIDEOID:66e3059ac41a58579bb5dec31a5e667c]] Bought this product because it said you could use nail glue on this\u2026. apparently you cant. It\u2019ll rip the fingers open","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2022"},{"id":"B0BC2XLWML-14","r":3.0,"t":"That the holder to the hand wasn't included","x":"I dislike it because the holder of the hand wasn't included which I would have paid more. It was a disappointment","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2022"},{"id":"B0BC2XLWML-15","r":5.0,"t":"Great for practice","x":"[[VIDEOID:9f44858e397a60217f1fc168f52c0cab]] This practice hand is so easy to use and great to work with. It is worth the money i have spent. Very flexible and sturdy, wasnt so easy to put the nails on but that\u2019s okay i still got them on. Will buy again","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2022"},{"id":"B0BC2XLWML-16","r":5.0,"t":"Practice Hand","x":"[[VIDEOID:755064198389fd66f0965a3f15ca9713]] I use this practice hand for acrylic nails & I absolutely love this ! It moves around good and this is my favorite hand to use when practicing nails. 5/5 definitely recommend!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2022"},{"id":"B0BC2XLWML-17","r":5.0,"t":"First time ever doing acrylic nails","x":"[[VIDEOID:1d44e9c6d95189827042781f4cb373c]] Love it, I thought I was going to have to purchase the expensive $90 one. Happy I didn\u2019t,  this one works just perfect.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2021"},{"id":"B0BC2XLWML-18","r":5.0,"t":"Stateboard Hand","x":"This hand is perfect for state board it is soft and feels realer than most that I have uses. 10/10 would buy to teach other students in the future.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2022"},{"id":"B0BC2XLWML-19","r":1.0,"t":"Don\u2019t waste your money on this nails won\u2019t even glue onto it!!","x":"[[VIDEOID:1f3d35582ca11d9796ccdcf7628114cb]] I tried using this hand to practice acrylic nails and it turns out it was just a waste of my money","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2022"},{"id":"B0BC2XLWML-20","r":5.0,"t":"100% recommend","x":"It help my sister do her nail 100% recommended the thing I like the most is that you can train on the hand and it will help you to paint nails","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B0BC2XLWML-21","r":5.0,"t":"Attached securely and pivots","x":"Bought 2 of these for 2 manikin heads I bought for my granddaughters . Attaches to the bathroom counter securely and it\u2019s adjustable.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2021"},{"id":"B0BC2XLWML-22","r":5.0,"t":"Good quality beginner friendly","x":"Hand is very easy to use. fingers flexible and hand. Feel rather realistic. I would definitely recommend for beginners!!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2022"},{"id":"B0BC2XLWML-23","r":5.0,"t":"Start off nail business","x":"If you just trying to get started with doing nails this would be great since the hand actually looks like a human hands","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2021"},{"id":"B0BC2XLWML-24","r":4.0,"t":"The hand is good","x":"Nails are hard to stick and the sticky stuff they send doesn\u2019t work. You\u2019ll have to try nail glue.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2023"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers find the hand flexible and realistic, making it good for practice and displaying designs.","cites":[2,5,6,8,11,12,13]},{"text":"Several reviewers complain about difficulty removing nails, especially with nail glue, and lack of clear removal instructions.","cites":[4,8,14]},{"text":"Some reviewers are disappointed that a stand or holder is not included.","cites":[9,15]},{"text":"A few reviewers note the nail beds are large or that it is not beginner friendly.","cites":[6,7]},{"text":"Some reviewers wish there were different skin tone options.","cites":[1]}]},"qa":[]}